🌙 Imaan bir Rasool (رسولوں پر ایمان)

📌 Har Rasool ka Paigham

✅ Har Rasool ne ek hi paigham pohunchaya:

Allah sirf ek hai
Sirf Allah ki ibaadat karni hai
Allah ke siwa kisi ki ibaadat nahi karni

📖 Daleel (Qur’an):
“Aur poochho (Aye Muhammad ﷺ) unn paighambaron se jinhein mai ne tum se pehle bheja tha: Kya humne kabhi siwaay Allah ke kisi aur mabood ki ibaadat karne ke liye kaha hai?”
(Al-Zukhruf 43:45)

🕌 Imaan lane mein kya shamil hai?

✅ Allah ne har ummat mein Rasool bheja
✅ Saare Rasool Allah ke bheje hue bande hain
✅ Allah ne Rasoolon ko insaan ki hidayat ke liye bheja
✅ Hume saare Rasoolon par imaan lana hai

Ek Rasool ka inkaar = sab Rasoolon ka inkaar ❌ (Shu’ara:105, Nisa 4:150-151)
✅ Jo kuch unpar nazil hua uspar imaan lana
✅ Rasoolon ki sifaat (qualities) par imaan lana

🔹 Rasool aur Nabi mein Farq

Rasool (رسول) → Paigham pohunchane waala jo nayi shari’at lekar aaye
Nabi (نبی) → Khabar dene waala jo pehle Rasool ki shari’at ko logon tak pohunchaye

📝 Misaal:

Musa (A.S.) ➝ Rasool
Haroon (A.S.) ➝ Nabi

📖 Kitne Rasool aaye?

✅ Qur’an (40:78) → Bahut Rasool aaye
✅ Hadees: 124,000 Anbiya bheje gaye
➡ Inme se 315 Rasool the
✅ Qur’an me sirf 25 Rasool ke naam hain (6:83-86)

🌟 Ulul-Azm Rasool (بڑے Rasool) – 5

Nuh (A.S.)
Ibrahim (A.S.)
Musa (A.S.)
Isa (A.S.)
Muhammad ﷺ

📖 Qur’an (Baqarah:253, Ahqaf:35) → Allah ne kuch Rasoolon ko fazilat di, unse baat ki, unko sabr ka misaal banaya.

✨ Rasoolon ki Sifaat

✅ Apni qaum me se the, apni zubaan bolte the
✅ Insaan the – khaate, peete, sote, nikah karte, rozi talaash karte
✅ Allah ki taraf se chune gaye
✅ Ghayb ka ilm nahi jaante the
✅ Fayda/nuksaan apni taraf se nahi pohuncha sakte the
✅ Nek, Allah ki ibaadat karne wale, behtareen akhlaaq rakhne wale
✅ Sadiq aur Ameen
✅ Kabira gunaahon se paak
✅ Ilm aur quwwat me afzal
✅ Allah ka paigham poori tarah pohunchate

🛡 Mushkilaat jo Rasoolon ko pesh aayi

✅ Bohot aazmaishen aayi
✅ Mukhalifat ke bawajood sabr kiya
✅ Ajar dugna mila
✅ Aksar Anbiya ne bakriyaan charayi – taake unko badi zimmedari ke liye tayyar kiya jaye

👤 Mukhtasir Zikr

Adam (A.S.) → Pehle Nabi, Allah ne apne haath se banaya, rooh phoonki, farishton se sajda karwaya
Nuh (A.S.) → 950 saal dawat di, logon ne mazaak udaya
Ibrahim (A.S.) → Khalilullah (Allah ke dost), 33 imtihaan, sab me kamiyaab, qayamat ke din sabse pehle libaas pehnaya jaayega
Musa (A.S.) → Kaleemullah, Firaun ko dawat di, Bani Israeel ko azaadi dilayi, Koh-e-Toor par Allah se kalaam kiya
Isa (A.S.) → Maryam (A.S.) ke bete, bina baap ke paida hue, Allah ke izn se mo’jizay, Allah ne unhe upar utha liya, qayamat se pehle wapas aayenge
Muhammad ﷺ → Khatam-un-Nabiyeen (Aakhri Nabi), Rahmatul-lil-‘Aalameen, sab ummaton ke Nabi

🌹 Nabi Muhammad ﷺ ke Huqooq (hamari zimmedari)

✅ Unpar imaan lana
✅ Unko jaan’ne ki koshish karna
✅ Sunnat ko follow karna
✅ Paigham aage pohunchana
✅ Deen me bid’at na karna
✅ Unko unke maqaam se upar na uthana
✅ Unpar durood bhejna

📌 Nateeja:
Imaan bir Rasool ka matlab hai saare Rasoolon aur Anbiya par imaan lana, unki sifaat par yaqeen rakhna, aur Muhammad ﷺ ko aakhri Rasool maankar unki sunnat ki pairwi karna.

